    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26f5ad8eb09631ef12e408fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与『看不见的什么人』交谈的赛马娘，\r\n以及被『看不见的什么人』猛拍肩膀的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "743e8832ebff890fe8fe8e3832df653f1d6889118fee758e1a7a3a5993cd2ced",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
