      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "似乎连空气也变得冰凉，我浑身的寒毛都竖了起来。\r\n……最后，我将一切都归咎于『错觉』，离开了那个地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22da3098cd48d74b95e3e616a6cb545a41635865d2fe7db184940bcc6f37ac3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
