    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bbeb90ca3af44a8d819c50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……总而言之！你也放弃那姑娘比较好吧？\r\n跟她扯上关系的话不会有什么好事儿吧……应该。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b694371ee0b613ae4ef33c271435fedaa78b98437a3ec9e9117ade1f11693f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
