    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1461c16c08be361ec5ffb1ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然昨夜是将一切都归咎于『错觉』了……\r\n但说实话，还是会不可避免地在意昨晚发生的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bd388506ede66905e3c38d3c6cce6e3acda19f3d6835073133c03dfc348c41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025001.json",
      "json_path": [
