    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50eaa0552eed144a8b7ad07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，同事刚刚说的『压根不在意他人的话语』有到底是怎么一回事？\r\n……她有什么不想被签约的内情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6a69d3c50ea24026b5a12f2dd69aafb9e9a64b61022ede5781dd78acbaa38c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025001.json",
      "json_path": [
