      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……大概是白天在见习赛马娘们训练的时候，\r\n不小心落在那边了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9269a8a2cf1c314c89571f2a75801ae772994e219143ca44c38181e6630eca9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
