    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2f698c9110b9279eb4e732",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我连忙回到白天来过的训练场。\r\n在那儿，手机正像要告知我自己的所在地一般，\r\n闪烁着电量告急的警告灯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e4642ac27b7d5c3f701e50e3a365c915a7646955cb37359de656d95d50ef0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
